type: software
title: "adoption-sim: complex contagion on synthetic organizational networks"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-10"
license: AGPL-3.0
authors:
  - family-names: "TODO-AUTHOR-FAMILY-NAME"
    given-names: "TODO-AUTHOR-GIVEN-NAME"
abstract: >-
  Research simulator of complex contagion (fractional thresholds with
  ready/willing/able gating) on synthetic two-layer organizational networks.
  Compares seeding strategies (broadcast, random, champions, cluster,
  line-manager-first) under explicit, logged modeling decisions. All outputs
  are synthetic and uncalibrated by design (v0.1).
keywords:
  - complex contagion
  - threshold models
  - organizational networks
  - diffusion of innovations
  - agent-based simulation
